<!--
  R95b — Tokyo Night (#1a1b26) replaces the R76-era Material teal #26A69A.
  The legacy raster ic_launcher.png (mipmap-hdpi/mdpi/xhdpi/xxhdpi/xxxhdpi)
  is the fallback on Android 7+ devices that don't render the adaptive
  icon. Modern (Android 8+) launchers read @color/ic_launcher_background
  from values/ic_launcher_background.xml (already #1a1b26 since R81) and
  use mipmap-anydpi-v26/. R95b keeps the legacy drawable in the same
  palette as the adaptive icon so a user who downgrades to a v0.6.0 APK
  on Android 7 still sees Tokyo Night, not teal.
-->
